<h1 align="center">Limpidity: Copyright Information</h1>

<p>Limpidity comic strips, artwork and related text are 
copyright &#169; Po Shan Cheah, i.e. me.</p>

<p>Internet distribution is permitted as long as:</p>

<ul>

<li>the material is used for <b>non-profit</b> purposes. It must be truly
non-profit with no banner ads or affiliate programs. Otherwise, ask before 
proceeding.</li>

<li>the comic strips are <b>not altered</b> in any way, other than making 
thumbnail images for links.</li>

<li>the artist, i.e. me, is <b>given credit</b>. 
Please include my name and either or both my web page address 
<a href="http://www.limpidity.com">http://www.limpidity.com</a> 
and e-mail address 
<a href="mailto:<%= email %>"><%= email %></a>.</li>

</ul>

<p>None of that applies to <b>print</b> and non-internet (e.g. CD-ROM)
publications. Always ask first. If your zine has paid subscriptions or ads then
I will have to ask for payment if you print the comic strips. For non-profit
publications, I will decide on a case-by-case basis.</p>

<p>Fanart is okay with me but I'd appreciate having a copy. If there is enough
interest, I'll open a fanart section on this website.</p>

<p>Sharing the comic strips <b>privately</b> is okay. Personal use 
(e.g. printouts, download and save, Windows wallpaper) is okay.</p>

<p>And finally, when in doubt, ask.</p>

